 "releases": [
  {
   "id": "mostroscopy-269231@2.9",
   "gameId": "mostroscopy-269231",
   "displayName": "Patch 2.9",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-02-09T21:04:50.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Good afternoon everyone!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Mostroscopy Patch 2.9 is now live, also known as the Post Xbox Patch, and well, what can we say, if you have an XBOX you can now enjoy Mostroscopy there too!!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "xboxSeries"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "We are very happy with this, as it is our second game coming to console, after Combate Monero which is also available on Playstation in addition to Steam!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "ps5"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "We were very busy these months making the console port, and we had to optimize many resources and elements of the game, and that was reflected in the quality of some filters in the steam version.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We have already created a new variation of a quality script that adjusts it to the console and steam versions, so if you check the game now it should look better, as it again has ambient occlusion shadows in the game. :)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In addition to that we altered a Luzbelle challenge, the no. 2, since it was very strange and did not work well, since it was made some time ago before the update and rebalancing patches.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "And we also changed the little mistake wich made Japanese the default language in the Main menu. sorry, it should be in english now.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Also, there's a little preview in the jukebox section for the next character... hang on a little longer and new characters, balance and hopefully more stuff will start arriving, also the number 2 of the comic will be available soon as a new DLC :)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
